{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791136560, "covers_from": "2026-10-04T17:56:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-04T17:57:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791136620, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-04T17:56:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "queue_number": 56837, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "市政", "content": "身為新北市民，第一次因爲沒有台北市的投票權而惋惜，好想投給沈伯洋啊啊啊", "display_name": "信義代表 Heimu禾慕", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T17:56:11+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 41723, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "環境", "content": "內湖四周圍都有很多山，很多房子都在山坡旁邊，每次下颱風大雨過後，我都要擔心停在地下室的被淹掉", "display_name": "內湖代表 灃承", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T17:56:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 9141, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "district": "songshan", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北是首善之都，但蟑螂老鼠橫行，垃圾桶堆滿垃圾，建物外觀黯淡無光，未做清潔，市容實在不像首都", "display_name": "松山代表 No.9,141", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T17:56:41+00:00", "duration_seconds": 8, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 24860, "sprite_key": "squirrel_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "交通", "content": "內湖到基隆路，下班時間塞車嚴重，遲遲未改善", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.24,860", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-04T17:56:49+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 44448, "sprite_key": "elephant_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "其他", "content": "可以建議新北宜蘭也增加這個溝通反映的渠道嗎？", "display_name": "信義代表 No.44,448", "mood": "hopeful", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 41723, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 灃承", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 9141, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_culture", "display_name": "松山代表 No.9,141", "district": "songshan", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"p